  "description": "Do you want a bike to ride everything urban? From quick trips to the local store and nearby parks, to rides to work, and all the places in between, the Beasley 27.5\" offers a sharp and sophisticated feel for amazing rides in any urban environment. Features include a 1x drive-train that makes shifting a breeze and Kenda Kwick 2.0 tires that ensure that harsh pavement is little more than an eyesore. Perhaps best of all, with its all-blacked-out aesthetic, it's as stealth as they come.\nHaro Beasley 27.5\" X6 series aluminum, tapered head tube\nInternal Threadless tapered headset\nRigid 27.5\" 6000 Series tapered aluminum fork\nAluminum, 38T chainring, Double chainguard\nShimano Acera 8-spd rear derailleur\nShimano Altus SL-M310 shifter\nShimano HG-31 8-spd 11-34t cassette\nMX-21 27mm Aluminum double wall rims\nPivit aluminum cassette 32h hubs\nKenda Kwick Seven.5 27.5x2.0\" tires\nJak-7 Mechanical disc brakeset w/ 160mm Rotors",
